= Citations

Optimal line breaking is due to Knuth and Plass @kp81; hyphenation patterns follow Liang @liang83, and the pair is cited again as @[kp81, liang83]. The TeXbook @knuth84 comes last in citation order even though it is first in the data. Citing @kp81 once more keeps its number; the uncited entry is omitted.

